              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-w-id="14e7c84d-0698-8d8d-c6bb-bb2603a9d15d" class="profit-card-bottom">
          <div class="profit-loss-box _02">
            <div class="profit-tax-content">
              <div class="profit-content-title-button">
                <h3 class="content-box-title section-title">Multiple Videos and Chats in One View</h3>
                <p class="profit-box-text">Watch multiple streams and interact with them simultaneously, layed out the way you like it.</p>
              </div>
              <a data-w-id="88412916-ae61-561d-6215-10843dc3d612" href="/features" class="white-button purple-button w-inline-block">
