                <p class="power-card-text">Drag your favorite channel right onto the canvas and
                  arrange it however you like. Tessera's intuitive interface makes it easy to customize your viewing experience.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div data-w-id="d452a178-8f25-6c1f-5744-b10113e0f1df" style="opacity:0" class="singlre-power-features">
